OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mainly dry
OL,6,Fevening and night with clear periods.
OL,7,FClouding over at times with the odd
OL,8,Flight shower across the east. A cold
OL,9,Fnight with patchy frost.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FMainly dry and cold with
OL,12,Fbright or sunny spells. Chance of a
OL,13,Flight shower in the north.
OL,14,
